    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "9ef6ab18-3240-49d3-8d73-18933cd9c081",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Bad Shot",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ELEGANT_LLAMA",
        "PublicId": "131467570706",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository df196d39-bf1c-4c78-9aa0-6d5f0790946e).Image",
        "Description": "47, it is the special time of the year where Cupid puts his bow on full-auto and starts reigning down love onto his victims. However, for one couple in particular, Cupid’s attempts at striking them both have failed. Stacy Filaminger, our client said she has been engaged to her fiance, Layne, for a couple of months, but that Layne pulled the plug on the whole shebang because, well, he’s an ass. Stacy requested we eliminate her former fiance and a few of his guard buddies at the Club H&#246;lle in Berlin, in retaliation for the love crimes he has committed. And 47, I know that it’s pretty far to take it just due to a breakup, but she’s offering a big reward, and as you know, we LOVE mula. Anyway, good luck, 47.\r\rSincerely, your biggest fan, Diana Burnwood\r\rThis contract was made by Eclipse for the HITMAN Community Roadmap. Join our discord at https://hitman.community/discord for more information!",
